{"events": [{"tStartMs": 0, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "When I was building the first version of Bolsilla alone in my apartment in Paris,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4480, "dDurationMs": 3279, "segs": [{"utf8": "I never would have thought that less than five months later,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 7760, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'd be in San Francisco at a 10-month run."}]}, {"tStartMs": 10240, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've been a founder and entrepreneur for over a decade."}]}, {"tStartMs": 13280, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's such a grind."}]}, {"tStartMs": 14320, "dDurationMs": 1119, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're always on."}]}, {"tStartMs": 15440, "dDurationMs": 1119, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're always working."}]}, {"tStartMs": 16560, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're always trying to solve the next problem."}]}, {"tStartMs": 19200, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Living in Paris, like this is my hometown,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 21200, "dDurationMs": 1679, "segs": [{"utf8": "but SF is the place to build."}]}, {"tStartMs": 22880, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's so clear to me now."}]}, {"tStartMs": 23920, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "Well, I really think that only in SF,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 26320, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can find the right community."}]}, {"tStartMs": 27920, "dDurationMs": 1679, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can find the right investors."}]}, {"tStartMs": 29680, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can find the right energy to help me take Bolsilla to the moon."}]}, {"tStartMs": 33520, "dDurationMs": 18220, "segs": [{"utf8": "Just tell me a little bit about Bolsilla's origin."}]}, {"tStartMs": 51740, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "When it started, why it started, how you started it?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 54700, "dDurationMs": 5119, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I started Bolsilla on the back of studying another company"}]}, {"tStartMs": 59820, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "with my ex-co-founder Mathieu, a company called Gipshop."}]}, {"tStartMs": 62860, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I had come from a very tech background,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 65340, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "working with Travis Kalanick."}]}, {"tStartMs": 67180, "dDurationMs": 3279, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I thought, hey, I want to build a company with a co-founder"}]}, {"tStartMs": 70460, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "that has a completely different worldview than mine."}]}, {"tStartMs": 73100, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so we can combine forces and build something amazing."}]}, {"tStartMs": 75740, "dDurationMs": 880, "segs": [{"utf8": "So that was Gipshop."}]}, {"tStartMs": 79150, "dDurationMs": 4159, "segs": [{"utf8": "But the reality is that our visions of the world clash so much"}]}, {"tStartMs": 83310, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "because there's a way to build a company with two people"}]}, {"tStartMs": 87870, "dDurationMs": 1839, "segs": [{"utf8": "being co-founders and being like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 89710, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "that created a tension where nothing was getting done"}]}, {"tStartMs": 92510, "dDurationMs": 3439, "segs": [{"utf8": "because there was no one central decision-making process."}]}, {"tStartMs": 95950, "dDurationMs": 2079, "segs": [{"utf8": "And everything was compromised."}]}, {"tStartMs": 98030, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Bolsilla started out as this frustration."}]}, {"tStartMs": 102110, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "I wanted to create solo just because I had just lived"}]}, {"tStartMs": 105390, "dDurationMs": 2799, "segs": [{"utf8": "an experience where I had a co-founder"}]}, {"tStartMs": 108190, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "and it was extremely frustrating."}]}, {"tStartMs": 122530, "dDurationMs": 5439, "segs": [{"utf8": "And also just building it in Paris, in this country"}]}, {"tStartMs": 127970, "dDurationMs": 3439, "segs": [{"utf8": "which has so much beauty, so much community, so much life."}]}, {"tStartMs": 131410, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "But I would also go to the market"}]}, {"tStartMs": 133650, "dDurationMs": 3519, "segs": [{"utf8": "where all these merchants that love their craft so much,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 137170, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "they love food and I love food and I love cooking."}]}, {"tStartMs": 139730, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so it was so great to meet them, talk about produce,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 143570, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "talk about the latest things they have,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 145330, "dDurationMs": 2479, "segs": [{"utf8": "talk about what's good these days, talk about what's in season."}]}, {"tStartMs": 180740, "dDurationMs": 25519, "segs": [{"utf8": "In the early Bolsilla days, it was honestly a lot of building."}]}, {"tStartMs": 206260, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "It was a very healthy building meaning like most of the days"}]}, {"tStartMs": 209540, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "I would work here, sometimes I would work in a solo house."}]}, {"tStartMs": 212420, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then at 7pm, always take time to see people,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 216420, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "see my brother, see my friends."}]}, {"tStartMs": 218180, "dDurationMs": 4879, "segs": [{"utf8": "I feel like building it in Paris was just a special time."}]}, {"tStartMs": 223060, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "I launched it mid-December and right away,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 225460, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "I could tell that people loved it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 227380, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "When I started approaching 100k runways"}]}, {"tStartMs": 229460, "dDurationMs": 1759, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I felt like if I stayed in Paris,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 231220, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "I would end up taking a good idea and being slowed down"}]}, {"tStartMs": 234900, "dDurationMs": 3919, "segs": [{"utf8": "by this country that has such beauty and has such potential."}]}, {"tStartMs": 238820, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "But in the current state of things,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 240180, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "in the current state of the way, the mindset of the people,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 243380, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "this is not where innovation comes around."}]}, {"tStartMs": 245220, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "This is not where things are actually going."}]}, {"tStartMs": 260690, "dDurationMs": 2319, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's funny because I told myself,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 263010, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "hey, do not cut your hair until you reach 100k revenue."}]}, {"tStartMs": 267970, "dDurationMs": 1839, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so my hair was like this."}]}, {"tStartMs": 271170, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "So right now it's 6am,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 273570, "dDurationMs": 3519, "segs": [{"utf8": "figuring out how fast I can get to a million AR."}]}, {"tStartMs": 277090, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "My retention is really good."}]}, {"tStartMs": 279490, "dDurationMs": 2079, "segs": [{"utf8": "Users seems to really like it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 281570, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so I'm trying to figure out how can I scale faster"}]}, {"tStartMs": 284850, "dDurationMs": 1439, "segs": [{"utf8": "with all the channels I could scale."}]}, {"tStartMs": 296340, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know, I moved to San Francisco a few weeks ago."}]}, {"tStartMs": 299300, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "My whole plan for being in SF is I think this is the place"}]}, {"tStartMs": 302340, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "where I can really try to grow a lot more."}]}, {"tStartMs": 305860, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "I have a lot of things that I've been planning to do,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 308420, "dDurationMs": 1279, "segs": [{"utf8": "especially on the marketing side."}]}, {"tStartMs": 310500, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm excited about doing this marketing stunt"}]}, {"tStartMs": 313540, "dDurationMs": 5039, "segs": [{"utf8": "where I have Bolsia run my inbox and run the fundraising."}]}, {"tStartMs": 318580, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so I'm very excited about launching it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 321460, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think I'm probably going to be launching it next week."}]}, {"tStartMs": 323540, "dDurationMs": 3279, "segs": [{"utf8": "Do a cool little tweet to try to announce it,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 326820, "dDurationMs": 879, "segs": [{"utf8": "see if it picks up."}]}, {"tStartMs": 328420, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "The second thing I really want to do is do more founder-led marketing."}]}, {"tStartMs": 332980, "dDurationMs": 3359, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I think being on more podcasts would be super cool."}]}, {"tStartMs": 336340, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "I mean, it would be amazing if in February I could be on like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 339700, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't know, like five podcasts."}]}, {"tStartMs": 340740, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like it's kind of a goal I put for myself."}]}, {"tStartMs": 344260, "dDurationMs": 6650, "segs": [{"utf8": "Best in that domain."}]}, {"tStartMs": 350910, "dDurationMs": 1839, "segs": [{"utf8": "It has been that interesting."}]}, {"tStartMs": 352750, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "His A.I. agents built a company for him."}]}, {"tStartMs": 359310, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like what the hell have you created?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 361470, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "And this thing is just taken to the internet by storm."}]}, {"tStartMs": 366030, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "Because I truly believe that G.I. is here."}]}, {"tStartMs": 369470, "dDurationMs": 1439, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so here I was like, you know what,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 370910, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "stop thinking about what other people want."}]}, {"tStartMs": 372830, "dDurationMs": 560, "segs": [{"utf8": "What do you want?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 374510, "dDurationMs": 1439, "segs": [{"utf8": "Click a button, get a company."}]}, {"tStartMs": 377950, "dDurationMs": 480, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 380190, "dDurationMs": 2319, "segs": [{"utf8": "All right, dude, good document."}]}, {"tStartMs": 382510, "dDurationMs": 1280, "segs": [{"utf8": "See ya, bye."}]}, {"tStartMs": 383790, "dDurationMs": 1279, "segs": [{"utf8": "See you later, homie."}]}, {"tStartMs": 385070, "dDurationMs": 560, "segs": [{"utf8": "Peace."}]}, {"tStartMs": 385630, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "All right, all right, all right, all right, all right, all right."}]}, {"tStartMs": 387550, "dDurationMs": 2159, "segs": [{"utf8": "I mean, obviously, you're self-employed."}]}, {"tStartMs": 389710, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're not many employees,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 391070, "dDurationMs": 4879, "segs": [{"utf8": "but you work with agencies or consultants."}]}, {"tStartMs": 395950, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "I mean, like the way it started with Polsya,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 397550, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "it was like me alone with A.I. 24-7."}]}, {"tStartMs": 401230, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "And there was a lot of automations I was able to do"}]}, {"tStartMs": 404430, "dDurationMs": 1759, "segs": [{"utf8": "on how to get the product out."}]}, {"tStartMs": 406270, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "How to do the initial marketing."}]}, {"tStartMs": 407390, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "Me being a solo founder with A.I."}]}, {"tStartMs": 408990, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "and being able to have a $250 million company"}]}, {"tStartMs": 411390, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "is kind of crazy on its own, right?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 412990, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's actually crazy that I raised $30 million"}]}, {"tStartMs": 414990, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "and they gave it to a one-person show, right?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 417390, "dDurationMs": 1199, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's actually kind of crazy."}]}, {"tStartMs": 418590, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Wait a second, that narrative is so strong"}]}, {"tStartMs": 421390, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "that I should force myself to another employee,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 424430, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "which is an handicap sometimes."}]}, {"tStartMs": 426830, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "On engineering, I was like, well,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 428830, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "I kind of need people that can help me build the family."}]}, {"tStartMs": 433070, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "I need people that can help me build the foundation"}]}, {"tStartMs": 436670, "dDurationMs": 3359, "segs": [{"utf8": "of the infrastructure on top of which Polsya is built on,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 440030, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "which is a new infrastructure for agents, for A.I. agents."}]}, {"tStartMs": 443230, "dDurationMs": 1759, "segs": [{"utf8": "I met Ilan from Saipyam."}]}, {"tStartMs": 444990, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "I remember vividly, like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 446110, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "but this dinner was looking like, what do you do?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 448510, "dDurationMs": 2639, "segs": [{"utf8": "I was like, I'm building this A.I. that builds companies"}]}, {"tStartMs": 451150, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "autonomously, and he was like, what do you do?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 453310, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "He was like, well, I'm building infrastructure"}]}, {"tStartMs": 455230, "dDurationMs": 3199, "segs": [{"utf8": "for agents to be able to run autonomously."}]}, {"tStartMs": 458430, "dDurationMs": 1599, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I was like, that's kind of cool."}]}, {"tStartMs": 460030, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "I guess we should talk, you know?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 462030, "dDurationMs": 1280, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then he was like, well, if you want,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 463310, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "you can work at my office if you want."}]}, {"tStartMs": 465470, "dDurationMs": 1599, "segs": [{"utf8": "And we decided to work together."}]}, {"tStartMs": 474350, "dDurationMs": 9269, "segs": [{"utf8": "So, yeah, what were you just telling me about customers?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 483620, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, I mean, I've been growing quite a bit"}]}, {"tStartMs": 485860, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "with all the posts I've been posting on Twitter"}]}, {"tStartMs": 488420, "dDurationMs": 1759, "segs": [{"utf8": "and all the organic word of mouth."}]}, {"tStartMs": 490180, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "And there's actually a lot of customers that are in SF."}]}, {"tStartMs": 493860, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "I really think it's a good idea"}]}, {"tStartMs": 495540, "dDurationMs": 1439, "segs": [{"utf8": "for me to start meeting them"}]}, {"tStartMs": 497060, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "and asking them more specifically,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 498980, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "what are the expectations with Pulsia?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 500980, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "What exactly they're trying to build?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 502500, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "How I can make Pulsia better for them?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 504180, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's going to 10x my learnings"}]}, {"tStartMs": 505700, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "and try to make the product much better, faster."}]}, {"tStartMs": 507620, "dDurationMs": 879, "segs": [{"utf8": "Since they're in SF,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 508500, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think I should just meet them in person."}]}, {"tStartMs": 510020, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think it would be a great experience."}]}, {"tStartMs": 511940, "dDurationMs": 1439, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've been meeting one more customer,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 513380, "dDurationMs": 1679, "segs": [{"utf8": "and it's like, I actually love it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 515059, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "Understanding why you use it,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 516260, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "what's your, what are your expectations with it?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 518100, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like, how can I make it better?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 520020, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "I mean, I have like 13 different apps right now."}]}, {"tStartMs": 523460, "dDurationMs": 1599, "segs": [{"utf8": "What I do too is it just lets me know"}]}, {"tStartMs": 525060, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "how many visitors per day"}]}, {"tStartMs": 526660, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I kind of see what's working, what's not,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 529220, "dDurationMs": 1679, "segs": [{"utf8": "and then of course, something doesn't work."}]}, {"tStartMs": 530900, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I give it a while, then take it off,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 532580, "dDurationMs": 2079, "segs": [{"utf8": "put something new, add something to it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 534660, "dDurationMs": 720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Pulsia is great."}]}, {"tStartMs": 535780, "dDurationMs": 240, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah."}]}, {"tStartMs": 536020, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "And she really, she really is."}]}, {"tStartMs": 537860, "dDurationMs": 1439, "segs": [{"utf8": "Everything that she creates"}]}, {"tStartMs": 539300, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "is according to specifications,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 540900, "dDurationMs": 3759, "segs": [{"utf8": "but she also has her own benchmarks to start."}]}, {"tStartMs": 544660, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "She does the research for you."}]}, {"tStartMs": 546180, "dDurationMs": 720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Thank you so much."}]}, {"tStartMs": 546900, "dDurationMs": 1279, "segs": [{"utf8": "A lot of the people I meet,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 548180, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "oftentimes like they had one idea,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 550100, "dDurationMs": 1279, "segs": [{"utf8": "they use Pulsia,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 551380, "dDurationMs": 480, "segs": [{"utf8": "and then they're like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 551860, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "well, there's other ideas I want to do, right?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 554340, "dDurationMs": 959, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I think entrepreneurship"}]}, {"tStartMs": 555300, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "is a lot about trial and error, right?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 557460, "dDurationMs": 879, "segs": [{"utf8": "Trying stuff."}]}, {"tStartMs": 558340, "dDurationMs": 1839, "segs": [{"utf8": "As you said, I have this idea."}]}, {"tStartMs": 560180, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "I built it, how people are responding,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 562740, "dDurationMs": 1279, "segs": [{"utf8": "how people want to pay,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 564020, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "how people are using it, getting feedback."}]}, {"tStartMs": 565700, "dDurationMs": 2159, "segs": [{"utf8": "I have been playing with AI agents"}]}, {"tStartMs": 567860, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I could build something similar"}]}, {"tStartMs": 570100, "dDurationMs": 1039, "segs": [{"utf8": "to what Pulsia does,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 571140, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "but it would take a lot of time"}]}, {"tStartMs": 572740, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I would have to give it a lot of tools"}]}, {"tStartMs": 574580, "dDurationMs": 959, "segs": [{"utf8": "and I would have to test it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 576100, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so for someone that's out of the box"}]}, {"tStartMs": 578020, "dDurationMs": 3279, "segs": [{"utf8": "that wants to see what an AI agent could do for them,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 581300, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think this is a great product."}]}, {"tStartMs": 583780, "dDurationMs": 2639, "segs": [{"utf8": "When you bring an empowered mass of people,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 586420, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "like you look at what movements were made of,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 588900, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "that comes from an empowered mass."}]}, {"tStartMs": 590980, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I think that's what's most interesting"}]}, {"tStartMs": 592900, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "about what you're doing."}]}, {"tStartMs": 594100, "dDurationMs": 1199, "segs": [{"utf8": "As you think about like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 595300, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "you know, there are some sort of limitations,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 597220, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "you do have to think in the box"}]}, {"tStartMs": 598580, "dDurationMs": 2319, "segs": [{"utf8": "of what is Pulsia kind of best geared at,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 600900, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "you know, SaaS companies, right?"}]}, {"tStartMs": 602420, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "And what I like is that"}]}, {"tStartMs": 603540, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "you're not providing that information to people"}]}, {"tStartMs": 605780, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "because that would then restrict their imagination."}]}, {"tStartMs": 608100, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're kind of allowing them to just be like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 610020, "dDurationMs": 639, "segs": [{"utf8": "go do it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 610660, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "And as you're dealing with a scaling problem,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 612900, "dDurationMs": 1759, "segs": [{"utf8": "eventually I think these other things"}]}, {"tStartMs": 614660, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "will sort itself out."}]}, {"tStartMs": 615860, "dDurationMs": 2559, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's kind of where what it really intrigues me"}]}, {"tStartMs": 618420, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "with what you're doing."}]}, {"tStartMs": 619540, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "I actually meet a lot of customers face to face"}]}, {"tStartMs": 621700, "dDurationMs": 2799, "segs": [{"utf8": "because it's a very different feeling"}]}, {"tStartMs": 624500, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "when you talk to someone face to face"}]}, {"tStartMs": 626420, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "about how they use your product,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 627620, "dDurationMs": 960, "segs": [{"utf8": "how they perceive it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 629460, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "And when you talk about a movement,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 631460, "dDurationMs": 719, "segs": [{"utf8": "I totally agree."}]}, {"tStartMs": 632180, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's like, that's why it's like"}]}, {"tStartMs": 633220, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "people that want to see competitors."}]}, {"tStartMs": 634820, "dDurationMs": 1839, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, well, everyone's building an amazing product."}]}, {"tStartMs": 636660, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like, you know, Reflate, Lavavold,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 638020, "dDurationMs": 1279, "segs": [{"utf8": "these are all great products."}]}, {"tStartMs": 639300, "dDurationMs": 879, "segs": [{"utf8": "But to me, it's like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 640820, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "they all will have to go to a world where like,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 643700, "dDurationMs": 3039, "segs": [{"utf8": "that empowers everyone at the lowest cost possible"}]}, {"tStartMs": 646740, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "to do whatever they want,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 647940, "dDurationMs": 959, "segs": [{"utf8": "to do whatever they want."}]}, {"tStartMs": 649620, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "I've been doing a lot more user interviews."}]}, {"tStartMs": 652900, "dDurationMs": 1279, "segs": [{"utf8": "Really talking to customers,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 654180, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "especially customers that are using the platform a lot."}]}, {"tStartMs": 656420, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "So this customer Mitchell has been using the platform"}]}, {"tStartMs": 658740, "dDurationMs": 639, "segs": [{"utf8": "for two months."}]}, {"tStartMs": 660100, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "He's making money on the platform."}]}, {"tStartMs": 661620, "dDurationMs": 1679, "segs": [{"utf8": "He's built a lot of different ideas."}]}, {"tStartMs": 663300, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know, I always think customers"}]}, {"tStartMs": 664500, "dDurationMs": 2159, "segs": [{"utf8": "are not going to complain about things."}]}, {"tStartMs": 666660, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "I get all those customer support emails,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 669140, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "but actually, you know, there's over"}]}, {"tStartMs": 670820, "dDurationMs": 2479, "segs": [{"utf8": "more than 5,000 people paying on the platform."}]}, {"tStartMs": 673300, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "And like, the people that contact me are very few,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 675540, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "but still they're very loud."}]}, {"tStartMs": 677060, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "And actually it's really cool to hear"}]}, {"tStartMs": 678500, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "a happy customer for the past two months"}]}, {"tStartMs": 680340, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "who's building a bunch of ideas,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 681940, "dDurationMs": 1359, "segs": [{"utf8": "is making 